00:24:21,340 --> 00:24:24,500
So subscribe and join our English practice family.

391
00:24:24,500 --> 00:24:29,700
Tell us in the comments what topic you want for our next video.

392
00:24:29,700 --> 00:24:32,980
Thank you so much for spending your time with us today.

393
00:24:32,980 --> 00:24:35,580
You are all great students.

394
00:24:35,580 --> 00:24:40,380
Keep practicing, keep learning, and don't forget to have fun with English.

395
00:24:40,380 --> 00:24:41,380
Bye everyone.

396
00:24:41,380 --> 00:24:44,540
Have a wonderful week and dream about your next vacation!

397
00:24:44,540 --> 00:24:46,100
Goodbye!

